INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This means a lot to me. When I get back home, I will send a postcard and some coin for what you\'ve done. Wish me luck when I set off!', 0),
(40093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done well in your task. If the Blackblood or Southsea Pirates had found this, they would have been able to raid innocent merchantmen with leisure.', 0),
(40094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Admiral Caelan\'s death has been avenged, and the captain from each ship now lies in a grave. I thank you for what you\'ve done. The marines will be overjoyed with such news of vengeance.', 0),
(40141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'My family has always been close knit, and I know that such a long length without hearing from me would certainly cause worry. I am simply happy to dispell such concern and let them know all is fine. Thanks again. This has meant a lot for me.', 0),
(40142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, yeah this should be everything. A meal worthy for the Admiral! Here, have some as thanks.', 0),
(40143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I salute you. You have made the waves a much safer place for all who travel them.', 0),
(40144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Admiral would be proud of everything you\'ve done. I have no doubt it will take the Southsea many weeks before someone is their new leader, and even then, they will be very much weaker than they were before. Cheers, the dead of the fleet have been avenged.', 0),
(40148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is it! Haha! Such fine work—you\'d make one excellent swashbuckler aboard the Waterbreaker when she is repaired!', 0),
(40149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You found this in the wreck of the pirate ship? I must say, that is some rather adventurous exploring! This logbook will help us learn quite a lot about pirates\' charts and patrol pathing and may help us locate some of their bases at sea.', 0),
(40150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Deeptide Naga have been up to something, but that is not what we are here to investigate. Good work in dispatching the foul creatures. Let us hope they prove no further harm to the crew.', 0),
(40151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is it! We had abandoned all serious hopes of reclaiming it, and now it is in our possession once again. A marvelous day, and it is all thanks to you.', 0),
(40152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is a shame what happened to the elves, but I know if we Kul Tirans were in a similar state, they would offer us the same kindness.', 0),
(40153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh... I had left this book upon an elvish vessel quite some time ago. Did you manage to recover it? I must say, I had considered this lost after the news of what happened. Thank you so much, my child, for returning this book.', 0),
(40155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'With their numbers thinned, it will take them much longer to organize an attack. Your actions have helped us greatly, but still, there is more to be done.', 0),
(40156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Such a crude thing. An ugly trophy it will make. With the Tyrant King removed, the Gor\'dosh will be splintered without leadership and may truly never recover. Many thanks. You have done good work this day.', 0),
(40157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Primalist Jongi lets a small sigh escape from him and nods his head.>$B$BI know what had to be done to gather these, mon. It was necessary for my people, and eventually, the wounds may heal once more. Thanks for what you have done.', 0),
(40158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Manaz\'ago takes his time to inspect the horn, slowly cracking a grin.> This be it. This be the one. Nice job, outsider. You did me good. There still be more to do, though, if you be wanting to help.', 0),
(40159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This be it, mon. It radiates an almost unbearable heat, and, when lit, should go up in a mighty fire hotter than anything we can produce. You done me well. Thank you, mon. Your efforts here may bring back our old magics.', 0),
(40160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I expected the Bengals be too much for you. With these fangs I will be creating the elixirs for our people. Thanks again, mon.', 0),
(40161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent work. Without the Hazu leaf, it would be much harder to make many of our recipes, and also to just simply relax, mon. Take this as a reward for my gratitude.', 0),
(40163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, we are finally doing something about Lapidis. It will be a tough task, given how powerful the man is.', 0),
(40164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hydromancer Lapidis, I have heard the name from before the horrific Third War. He was spoken as one of the most powerful of his kind. He refused to give us a lesson within Dalaran of his great magics, or to at the least, show us how it was done.', 0),
(40165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent work, with this orb I can begin to work with the magic of this key to replicate some of the traces that are present.', 0),
(40166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There.. It is done, the key has had its magical properties manipulated, and should contain similar enchantment.', 0),
(40167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm. So there is still more to be done, who knew that Lapidis had such potent magic that not even Dalaran could crack it. There must be some other way.', 0),
(40168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, they are looking into Lapidis, it is about time. The man was always a shady figure, one who hid most of his studies and his work, and no doubt had nefarious purpose. I would suspect he is the reason we are all here.', 0),
(40169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Magus Valgon sent you, interesting, let me have a look then and I will see what I can do.', 0),
(40170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The troll looks almost filled with glee>. You have done well, this wretch had much worse coming to him, but this shall do, especially given my current state. Fine, give me that key, I will do as you asked, my word is my bond.', 0),
(40171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Now that the key is attuned, and enchanted, we can begin our planning to destroy Hydromancer Lapidis.', 0),
(40210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, now you know what is at stake, and you will help me retake these islands, if not for your own selfish whims of \'virtue\' to stop some evil.', 0),
(40211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'We move forward, as much as the satyr are nothing more than worthless agents of a fading order. They still had this coming, and much more should I ever have the agency to torment them.$B$BWith these horns and lotus I can begin to channel energy to locate this dark source with my own magics. Until then, there is much more to do before we can unveil the source of the evil that taints the islands.', 0),
(40212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Who did you say you were sent by again?', 0),
(40213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Zul\'Hazu was a breeding ground for the corrupt, and the defiled. They swept aside my magic and my teachings for a chance to indulge in greater powers. They are nothing but harlots to the highest bidder, and it is retribution to dispense justice upon them.', 0),
(40214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done well mortal, your help here, I must admit, has been insturmental. You have earned a place upon these islands as long as you desire to be here. As long as you understand that my rule here is now concrete.$B$BAs a token of my appreciation to enact revenge, and give me back my rightful throne, you are to be rewarded, as one should for noble deeds. May you find use for the treasure I offer, and may you prosper on whatever path you choose.', 0),
(40251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Insom\'ni takes his time to gaze over the necklace, his body seems invigorated, and energized by its very presence. Slowly, he would place it around his neck, and exhale a heavy breath of relief.>$B$BIt has been a long time since I have felt such energy, it is as if both halves to my soul have been reconnected after many long years. I can not even begin to explain such a feeling, too long has it been that I have been seperated from my essence.$B$B<A grin would spread across Insom\'ni, his face taking on a very intense gaze>.$B$BNow, let us begin our work.', 0),
(40303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This... This is the head of Lapidis! It is done, his horror has ceased?!$B$BWhat you have done here is truly heroic, truly worthy of legend. You have assured our survival upon this island, and triumphed over a great evil, a great evil that would have surely been our downfall. Kul Tiras and the Anchor have been given justice, for all of the crimes this man has caused against our people.$B$BPlease, as a token of our gratitude, and in Caelan\'s name, have a just reward.', 0),
(40370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You found it! Thank you, thank you, thank you! Woooah, it really looks like a sun! You\'re my new best friend!$B$BThere aren\'t many children here besides me, so I feel lonely sometimes. But with this necklace, I can be brave like my mom and dad.$B$BThey were sailors and one day I\'ll be a marine just like mama Eliza!', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40092, 0, 0, 'Murlocs are a dreadful race of creatures, are they not?', 0),
(40093, 0, 0, 'Have you had any luck in finding the logs?', 0),
(40094, 0, 0, 'Have you had any luck?', 0),
(40141, 0, 0, 'Have you seen my brothers yet? It will require travelling, but I would appreciate it greatly.', 0),
(40142, 0, 0, 'Make sure those crawler legs are juicy!', 0),
(40143, 0, 0, 'The Southsea Freebooters must be stopped if we are to ever leave this place.', 0),
(40144, 0, 0, 'Once the leaders are dead, the pirates will be sent into a state of chaos to establish new leadership.', 0),
(40148, 0, 0, 'Any luck, matey?', 0),
(40149, 0, 0, 'Is there something that I can help you with?', 0),
(40150, 0, 0, 'Has it been done? Have you traveled to Gillijim?', 0),
(40151, 0, 0, 'The Aqua Stone is of much importance to us here, and we must recover it.', 0),
(40152, 0, 0, 'Have the crew been put to rest?.', 0),
(40153, 0, 0, 'Yes, child? Are you here to learn about the Light?', 0),
(40155, 0, 0, 'Brutality, that is all they know, and that is all they shall receive.', 0),
(40156, 0, 0, 'There is no diplomacy to be had. All that is left is to kill the king.', 0),
(40157, 0, 0, 'I would suggest bringing friends for such a task. The city will be difficult to enter.', 0),
(40158, 0, 0, 'The Thunderhead I hear be a powerful creature. Keep your wits about you.', 0),
(40159, 0, 0, 'This jungle, you find it yet?', 0),
(40160, 0, 0, 'You be havin\' trouble?', 0),
(40161, 0, 0, 'Any luck finding Hazu leaves out there, mon?', 0),
(40163, 0, 0, 'Oh, yes, has the Colonel sent you?', 0),
(40164, 0, 0, 'What brings you to Dalaran?', 0),
(40165, 0, 0, 'Has the orb been obtained?', 0),
(40166, 0, 0, 'I think I\'ve done it.', 0),
(40167, 0, 0, 'Have you learned anything new about the key?', 0),
(40168, 0, 0, 'Flakereef sent you? I haven\'t spoken with him in quite a while now.', 0),
(40169, 0, 0, 'What do you need from me, adventurer?', 0),
(40170, 0, 0, 'Have you found that blackhearted mongrel yet?', 0),
(40171, 0, 0, 'How have you fared? Have you gotten any answers about the key?', 0),
(40210, 0, 0, 'Open your mind, and listen, wisdom can be found anywhere.', 0),
(40211, 0, 0, 'There is much work to do, and little time, get out there and do my bidding.', 0),
(40212, 0, 0, 'Travel, and with haste. There is much to do, and little time to do it, mortal.', 0),
(40213, 0, 0, 'Have you dealt with those rebellious insects yet?', 0),
(40214, 0, 0, 'We must be cautious.', 0),
(40251, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40303, 0, 0, 'Hello again $N, what can I do for you?', 0),
(40370, 0, 0, 'I like stargazing at night. I know my mom is looking at me and I don\'t want her to think I\'ve forgotten her.$B$BDid you find her necklace?', 0);
